Java Application Architecture Overview
8:08 PM
Welcome to the Java + Spring Boot World!
If you already know the Node.js MVC pattern (Express.js, controllers, models, middlewares, routes, and npm), you already understand 80% of backend architecture. The mental model is identical—only the syntax, type safety, and tooling differ.

This guide connects every Java concept directly to its Node.js equivalent, details the entire system architecture, breaks down every file and folder, explains how to run everything, and prepares you to answer any question about this project with confidence.

